{{!
    @template tool_vae/import_fiches_page

    The page "Importer des fiches de France compétences", below its heading: a refusal; or the result of a plan, the way to
    try again and the button to go on; or the preview, a word on the time it takes and the form of the confirmation; or the
    numbers, the two ways to get the export and the link to take back the numbers already imported, with the form.

    The template holds no logic: the states exclude one another before, in tool_vae\output\import_fiches_page. The texts are
    escaped (double braces). Five keys are HTML (triple braces): noticehtml, a notification of the core
    ($output->notification()); resultshtml, the template tool_vae/fiche_results; continuehtml, the button of the core
    ($output->continue_button()); previewhtml, the template tool_vae/fiche_preview; formhtml, a form of the core
    (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * noticehtml - false, or HTML: the refusal, the result not kept, or the failure of the last send
    * resultshtml - false, or HTML: the result of a plan
    * redo - false, or an object {url, label}: the way to try again what was not written
    * continuehtml - false, or HTML: the button to go on
    * previewhtml - false, or HTML: the preview of a plan
    * wait - false, or an object {text}: the import takes a while
    * numbers - false, or an object {intro, neutral, known}: known is false or an object {url, label}
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form of the page

    Example context (json):
    {
        "noticehtml": false,
        "resultshtml": false,
        "redo": false,
        "continuehtml": false,
        "previewhtml": false,
        "wait": false,
        "numbers": {
            "intro": "Type the numbers of the records to import.",
            "neutral": "Nothing is sent before you choose a way.",
            "known": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/import_fiches.php?known=1", "label": "Take back the numbers"}
        },
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/import_fiches.php\"></form>"
    }
}}
{{#noticehtml}}
{{{noticehtml}}}
{{/noticehtml}}
{{#resultshtml}}
{{{resultshtml}}}
{{/resultshtml}}
{{#redo}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/redo}}
{{#continuehtml}}
{{{continuehtml}}}
{{/continuehtml}}
{{#previewhtml}}
{{{previewhtml}}}
{{/previewhtml}}
{{#wait}}
<p class="small">{{text}}</p>
{{/wait}}
{{#numbers}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
<p class="small">{{neutral}}</p>
{{#known}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/known}}
{{/numbers}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
